{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">旺角有住宅單位發生火警，消防在單位救出3貓2狗，全部死亡，無人受傷。起火單位戶主涉偷電被捕。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.FIRE.MK-0000_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026YJSqpmSjGC1784842506.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.FIRE.MK-0000_001.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">警方昨晚九時許接報，指通菜街有住宅單位起火，消防到場將火救熄。初步懷疑是冷氣機短路起火，警方調查後發現起火單位涉嫌偷電，將52歲女戶主拘捕。52人疏散到安全地方。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.FIRE.MK-0000_002.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026ELMHAlHUMf1784842515.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.FIRE.MK-0000_002.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">單位內其中一隻小貓被困，由消防員救出並為牠急救，愛護動物協會派員到場處理，其後證實單位內所有貓狗死亡。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-23T22:19:17.032986+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":180,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}